    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.hipatterns\n\n### Description\n\nHello!\n\nI recently written the LuaCATS types for the highlighters format in my config:\nhttps://github.com/bew/dotfiles/blob/f13fa812fa2827a411f97ecfd983f0f502418ae0/nvim-wip/lua/mycfg/hl_patterns/init.lua#L28-L47\n\nWould you be okay if I made a PR to add those? (using `MiniHiPatterns.` as the prefix of course)\n\nThis would help a lot when writing new highlighters or to get types for function parameters.",
